  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4857918aa396e664da4bf6e1e0405844, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level1(1-4)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - "\"What was your most beloved piece? The one you\u2019re most proud of...?\""
  - "Ah, my pi\xE8ce de r\xE9sistance!\r"
  - I once crafted a lamp so radiant that it outshone the stars. It was a truly elegant,
    timeless, and utterly unique masterpiece. Everyone who saw it was captivated.
  - 'Even Claire said it was one of the finest works to come out of the workshop.

    The
    inspiration came from my brilliance, naturally.'
  - "And I suppose\u2026 also a particular wisteria tree I was fond of in my youth.
    Its cascading blooms were so delicate, so enchanting. I wanted to capture that
    beauty in glass, to make it eternal.\r\n"
  - "But, of course, such artistry requires more than just inspiration. It takes
    skill, vision, and a touch of genius\u2014all of which I possess in abundance.\r\n"
  responses: []
